OL,3,ASir Ian McKellen leads tributes to
OL,4,A'beloved actor' Sir Patrick Stewart
OL,5,Aafter death aged 86
OL,6,
OL,7,FIan McKellen and William Shatner lead
OL,8,Ftributes to Patrick Stewart, the
OL,9,Flegendary Star Trek and stage actor,
OL,10,Fwho died on Thursday aged 86
OL,12,FMcKellen describes Stewart as a "man to
OL,13,Frely on, to admire and in my case,
OL,14,Flove"; Shatner says the actor "stood
OL,15,Ffor the best of us"
OL,17,FFellow Star Trek cast member George
OL,18,FTakei calls Stewart an "irreplaceable
OL,19,Flegend"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
